# Inputs of the QA fingerprint (.claude/scripts/fingerprint.sh).
# One git pathspec per line. A line starting with ! is excluded.
# Rule: include everything TEST and REVIEW check (code, assets, build config);
# exclude docs/, reports, and the plan, so writing a report or running /finish
# never makes a PASS stale, but any code edit does.
#
# Default: the whole repo minus docs and workflow files. /build:setup narrows it,
# e.g. for a Vite app:  src  public  scripts  index.html  package.json  vite.config.ts  tsconfig*.json  eslint.config.js
.
!docs
!.claude
!PLAN.md
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!ai-workflow-kit
